  "notes": "Announced in the July 2025 Community Direct as a subscription feature for early 2026; the March 2026 Community Direct restated it as Custom Seas, free to all, 'later this year'; it shipped with Season 20 on 18 June 2026. Against the original early-2026 window (ending 30 April) the delivery was 49 days late; against the restated window it was on time. Whether free-instead-of-subscription is a scope change is a human judgement and no override has been set."
